# Scheduling / optimization
# --------------------
# We now transform kernel_symm_base using Exo scheduling primitives.
# The main goals are:
#   - tile the column dimension (j) to improve cache locality
#     when streaming rows of B and C;
#   - parallelize the outer i-loop of Phase 1, which has no
#     cross-iteration dependencies, using OpenMP.

p = kernel_symm_base

# Tile the j-loop of Phase 1 (the first j-loop encountered).
# After tiling:
#   for i in ...
#     for jo in ...
#       for ji in 0..TILE_J:
